#. module: pms_fastapi_reconcile_lock_date
#: code:addons/pms_fastapi_reconcile_lock_date/models/account_move.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(invoice)s replaces %(original)s, whose money is held by its credit note, "
"but it is split in several customer lines, so where to put that money is "
"ambiguous. Give it a payment term without instalments."
msgstr ""
"%(invoice)s sustituye a %(original)s, cuyo dinero está en su rectificativa, "
"pero tiene varias líneas de cliente, así que no está claro dónde ponerlo. "
"Ponle un plazo de pago sin vencimientos fraccionados."

#. module: pms_fastapi_reconcile_lock_date
#: code:addons/pms_fastapi_reconcile_lock_date/models/account_move.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(invoice)s replaces %(original)s, and the money of that invoice is waiting "
"for it on its credit note. Edit it instead of deleting or cancelling it."
msgstr ""
"%(invoice)s sustituye a %(original)s, y el dinero de esa factura la espera "
"en su rectificativa. Edítala en vez de borrarla o cancelarla."
